  of the linear system acts on the chart ring by the invertible substitution
  `Algebra.linearSubstEquiv`, which carries one universal linear form to another
  (`Algebra.linearSubst_universalLinearForm`) and hence identifies the two chart rings
  (`Algebra.quotientLinearSubstEquiv`) and transports the fraction-field presentation
  (`Algebra.linearSubstChartAlgebra`, `Algebra.isFractionRing_linearSubstChart`). The conclusions
  are literally unchanged because the subfield of `Ω` generated over `k` by the images of the
  parameters is the same for the two bases (`Algebra.adjoin_range_eq_of_linearSubst`).
