  basis but states nothing about its values; `Module.Basis.exists_sumExtend` records them, with
  the index type left existential.
* **Available: the whole substitution datum of the chart statements.**
  `Stacks.Bertini.FamilyDivisors.Hypotheses.exists_chart_substitution` of
  `StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Morphisms.Fibres.BertiniChartSubstitution`: a chart, the two
  mutually inverse matrices `Stacks.Bertini.FamilyDivisors.substMatrix` and
  `Stacks.Bertini.FamilyDivisors.substMatrixInv` (`Module.Basis.toMatrix_mul_toMatrix_flip`,
  reindexed along `ULift.down` onto `Stacks.Bertini.FamilyDivisors.basisIndex`), the tuple `g` of
