  `Stacks.Bertini.FamilyDivisors.reducedChartDivisorRing`, with structure map evaluation at `ξ`.
  The general statement is
  `AlgebraicGeometry.IsAffineOpen.exists_isFractionRing_residueField_genericPoint` of
  `StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.MoreMorphisms.GenericFibre.GenericResidueFieldNilradical`:
